{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act11d0_level_act11d0_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act11d0",
  "stageId": "act11d0_05",
  "title": "冬灵挽歌",
  "storyCode": "TW-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "381c4544d8c0230a2b0fb89a423bc6c67cc4cea664fbf2ae74f36a326c5d9fbc",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "九尾狐活动 5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......歌声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，整个街道都回荡着歌声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "淡蓝的暮色洒在萧条的街道上，零零星星的灯火之间，有人生活。\n二人目光所及的街道上空无一人，朦胧的歌声织成了一张网，夕阳西下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "裸露的源石丛，躁动的抗议者，苍白的星空和泥砖一同陷入沉寂。\n歌声......只剩下歌声......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事......我看见了什么？这是......源石技艺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......民谣？还是诗歌？在日落的时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃伦姆德有这样的习俗吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......亚叶姐姐，你听得懂歌词吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......但这是莱塔尼亚语吗？现代的莱塔尼亚语可没有这么晦涩的发音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但是，很好听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像是第一次在罗德岛舰桥上眺望大地那样，悠扬......古老......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是......这的确是法术......和东国的某些古老技艺一样！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把人找出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白，但是找出来之后呢？直接逮捕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_068",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会被别有用心的人当做煽动的借口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是为了防止他们挑拨感染者与非感染者的关系，始作俑者说不定就是冬灵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林长官！？这、这是要做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是冬灵的歌谣，只在古老的祭典和葬礼上出现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冬灵人是挑拨感染者和非感染者矛盾，带领那些危险分子破坏城镇动力设施的罪魁祸首。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在不是谈宽容的时候，我认为这是某种信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不会无端暴露自己，肯定有其他人在暗中行动，而且多半都是术师，留个心眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——冬灵人到底指什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本地的卡普里尼，在几百年前，他们才是这片群山的住民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......然后是沃伦姆德和冬灵人的冲突，就这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。不止如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是单纯的殖民问题的话，哥伦比亚，雷姆必拓，哪个国家都有过这样的历史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能让你们想方设法避开话题的话，会这么简单吗？只是矛盾和冲突？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道我该不该告诉你们，这的确超过了罗德岛有必要知道的范畴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "由一位宪兵把这些事情冠冕堂皇地告诉一家境外企业，这会让某些贵族十分地不高兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "贵族......？不高兴？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——安托为了帮你们牺牲了！现在还是讲面子的时候吗！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚、亚叶姐姐！牺牲......不该变成我们争吵的借口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林长官......！可以先停下这场搜捕吗？这会让大家的情绪更糟，会让事情无法挽回的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，唯一的线索近在眼前，我们不能放过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林，莱塔尼亚那么多的移动城邦，那些身居高塔之巅的贵族，有谁管过你们的死活？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算大裂谷出现，倘若最近的移动城邦倾力支援，当真会出现饥荒这种事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塞弗林，看清楚是谁在帮助你们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道......亚叶小姐，我比谁都清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我也清楚，罗德岛帮不了我们一辈子。等到事件解决，沃伦姆德重回它应有的位置时，我不希望收到来自某座高塔的信件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......请理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是亚叶姐姐，我们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——爆炸！？又是袭击？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官、长官！救救我们！我们需要帮助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢点，怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_065",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们、他们激活了那些城防装置！爆炸，火焰，他们——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷静点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官！感染者们、感染者们抓住了所有在十二音街道巡逻的宪兵！我们失去联络了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们利用那些留声机负隅顽抗，现在整个街道已经失去控制——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": ".......他们不该这么井井有条，谁在指挥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不清楚——但是很多非感染者也加入了抗议的队伍！沃伦姆德已经被......分割成两半了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿，冬灵人......这下好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "包围整条街道，控制人群，我们要把街道抢回来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——咳咳，咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死......你先回议事厅，拉响警报，现在开始不只是单纯的感染者纠纷了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沃伦姆德进入戒严状态，让所有民兵集合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是如果现在我们自相残杀，沃伦姆德肯定坚持不过这个冬天——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照我说的做！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔佳娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_069",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遵、遵命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于罗德岛的二位......你们，你们就按照自己觉得正确的想法去做吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坦白说，我们没有空来盯着你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要求更多的情报——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但、但我们应该先参与救援......很多无辜的人都被卷进来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我们会找到凶手的，在这之后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沃伦姆德一定会给罗德岛一个满意的答复。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你们能信守承诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞弗林",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_066",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我到时候还活着的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstreet1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......亚叶姐姐，我们刚才应该阻止塞弗林长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有用，你也看到了，他们都很激动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果真像长官说的那样，饥荒近在眼前，我们却还要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......只有快点找出犯人，才能平息这场动乱，放过这条线索，会很糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是那个意思......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐，你真觉得找到那个凶手，我们就能解决问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——亚叶姐姐，冷静一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......铃兰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐也清楚......现在大家都在气头上，都不太清醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得......虽然只是我的感觉，但我的感觉很准的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我觉得也许......有什么更糟糕的事情已经开始发生了。那种，说不出对错的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们要做的，是尽可能帮助那些被卷进来的无辜镇民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "亚叶姐姐......如果不拦着塞弗林长官的话，事情真的会变得很糟糕的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚叶",
      "speakerId": "char_345_folnic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也许吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（欲言又止）......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "speakerId": "char_358_lisa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
